            'deskripsi' => '{"id":"<p data-start=\\"446\\" data-end=\\"809\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">Tidak hanya fokus pada kerajinan kayu dan akrilik, KayuArem juga terus mengembangkan diri dalam pemanfaatan&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"554\\" data-end=\\"575\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">teknologi digital</span>&nbsp;untuk mendukung usaha. Pada&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"604\\" data-end=\\"646\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Lomba Inovasi Teknologi Informasi 2025</span>&nbsp;yang diselenggarakan oleh komunitas TI Bekasi bersama Dinas Kominfo, KayuArem turut berpartisipasi dengan mengusung tema&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"768\\" data-end=\\"806\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">“Digitalisasi UMKM Kerajinan Kayu”</span>.</p><p data-start=\\"811\\" data-end=\\"858\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">Dalam lomba ini, KayuArem menampilkan konsep:</p><ul data-start=\\"859\\" data-end=\\"1128\\" style=\\"padding-left: 2rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\"><li data-start=\\"859\\" data-end=\\"921\\"><p data-start=\\"861\\" data-end=\\"921\\"><span data-start=\\"861\\" data-end=\\"883\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Website interaktif</span>&nbsp;untuk katalog dan pemesanan produk,</p></li><li data-start=\\"922\\" data-end=\\"987\\"><p data-start=\\"924\\" data-end=\\"987\\"><span data-start=\\"924\\" data-end=\\"963\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Integrasi sistem database sederhana</span>&nbsp;untuk manajemen stok,</p></li><li data-start=\\"988\\" data-end=\\"1128\\"><p data-start=\\"990\\" data-end=\\"1128\\">serta&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"996\\" data-end=\\"1017\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">penerapan QR Code</span>&nbsp;pada produk agar pelanggan bisa langsung mengakses informasi bahan, cara perawatan, dan detail custom order.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\\"1130\\" data-end=\\"1346\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">“Teknologi sangat penting untuk UMKM saat ini. Dengan digitalisasi, kami bisa lebih dekat dengan pelanggan, lebih efisien dalam produksi, dan tentu lebih siap menghadapi persaingan pasar,” ujar perwakilan KayuArem.</p><p data-start=\\"1348\\" data-end=\\"1517\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">Partisipasi KayuArem dalam lomba ini mendapat apresiasi dari dewan juri, terutama karena mampu memadukan&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"1453\\" data-end=\\"1478\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">kerajinan tradisional</span>&nbsp;dengan&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"1486\\" data-end=\\"1514\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">inovasi teknologi modern</span>.</p>","en":"Not only focusing on wood and acrylic crafts, Kayarem also continues to develop itself in the use of digital technology to support businesses. In the 2025 Information Technology Innovation Competition organized by the Bekasi IT Community together with the Ministry of Communication and Information, Kayarem participated with the theme \\"Digitalization of MSMEs of Wood Crafts\\". In this competition, Kayarem displays the concept: Interactive Website for Catalogs and Ordering Products, Integration of Simple Database Systems for Stock Management, as well as the application Important for MSMEs today. With digitization, we can be closer to customers, more efficient in production, and of course more prepared to face market competition, \\"said Kayarem representative."}',
