            'deskripsi' => '{"id":"<p data-start=\\"441\\" data-end=\\"769\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">Kayu Arem kembali hadir membawa inovasi baru dalam dunia kerajinan kayu dan akrilik. Pada&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"530\\" data-end=\\"568\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Pameran Furnitur Lokal Bekasi 2025</span>&nbsp;yang diselenggarakan di&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"593\\" data-end=\\"616\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Living Plaza Bekasi</span>&nbsp;tanggal&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"625\\" data-end=\\"647\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">12–15 Oktober 2025</span>, KayuArem memperkenalkan koleksi terbarunya yang menggabungkan unsur&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"717\\" data-end=\\"731\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">kayu alami</span>&nbsp;dengan sentuhan&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"748\\" data-end=\\"766\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">akrilik modern</span>.</p><p data-start=\\"771\\" data-end=\\"924\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">Booth KayuArem menjadi salah satu daya tarik pengunjung berkat desain yang unik dan detail pengerjaan yang rapi. Koleksi baru yang dipamerkan meliputi:</p><ul data-start=\\"925\\" data-end=\\"1207\\" style=\\"padding-left: 2rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\"><li data-start=\\"925\\" data-end=\\"983\\"><p data-start=\\"927\\" data-end=\\"983\\"><span data-start=\\"927\\" data-end=\\"956\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Lampu meja kayu + akrilik</span>&nbsp;dengan konsep minimalis,</p></li><li data-start=\\"984\\" data-end=\\"1044\\"><p data-start=\\"986\\" data-end=\\"1044\\"><span data-start=\\"986\\" data-end=\\"1009\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Rak dinding modular</span>&nbsp;yang bisa disesuaikan kebutuhan,</p></li><li data-start=\\"1045\\" data-end=\\"1120\\"><p data-start=\\"1047\\" data-end=\\"1120\\"><span data-start=\\"1047\\" data-end=\\"1081\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Meja kopi kombinasi kayu solid</span>&nbsp;dengan panel akrilik tembus pandang,</p></li><li data-start=\\"1121\\" data-end=\\"1207\\"><p data-start=\\"1123\\" data-end=\\"1207\\">serta beberapa produk&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"1145\\" data-end=\\"1173\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">custom dekorasi interior</span>&nbsp;yang mendapat banyak perhatian.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\\"1209\\" data-end=\\"1480\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">“Pameran ini bukan hanya tentang memamerkan produk, tapi juga kesempatan untuk berinteraksi langsung dengan pelanggan dan mendengar masukan mereka. Kami senang banyak pengunjung yang tertarik dengan konsep kayu dan akrilik yang kami hadirkan,” ujar perwakilan KayuArem.</p><p data-start=\\"1482\\" data-end=\\"1731\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">Acara ini diikuti oleh puluhan pengrajin dan produsen furnitur lokal dari Bekasi dan sekitarnya. Selain menampilkan produk, pengunjung juga bisa mengikuti demo singkat, talkshow desain interior, serta mendapatkan promo khusus dari peserta pameran.</p>","en":"Arem wood is back to bring new innovations in the world of wood and acrylic crafts. At the Bekasi 2025 local furniture exhibition held at Living Plaza Bekasi on 12-15 October 2025, Kayarem introduced its latest collection that combines natural wood elements with a touch of modern acrylic. Booth Kayarem is one of the attractions of visitors thanks to a unique design and neat workmanship detailed. The new collection on display includes: wooden table + lamps with minimalist concepts, modular wall shelves that can be adjusted for needs, solid wood combination coffee tables with transparent acrylic panels, as well as some custom products that get a lot of attention. This was attended by dozens of local furniture craftsmen and producers from Bekasi and surrounding areas. In addition to displaying products, visitors can also take part in a short demonstration, interior design talkshow, and get special promos from exhibitors."}',
