                'judul' => '{"id":"5 Ide Menata Ruang Kerja dengan Sentuhan Kayu","en":"5 Ideas Organizing Works Space With A Touch of Wood"}',
            'deskripsi' => '{"id":"<p data-start=\\"357\\" data-end=\\"557\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">Kayu bukan hanya bahan dasar furnitur, tetapi juga elemen yang mampu memberikan suasana hangat dan natural pada ruang kerja. Berikut beberapa tips untuk menata ruang kerja Anda dengan sentuhan kayu:</p><ol data-start=\\"559\\" data-end=\\"1040\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\"><li data-start=\\"559\\" data-end=\\"677\\"><p data-start=\\"562\\" data-end=\\"677\\"><span data-start=\\"562\\" data-end=\\"593\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Gunakan Meja Kayu Minimalis</span><br data-start=\\"593\\" data-end=\\"596\\">Meja dengan finishing natural membuat ruangan terasa lebih tenang dan fokus.</p></li><li data-start=\\"678\\" data-end=\\"755\\"><p data-start=\\"681\\" data-end=\\"755\\"><span data-start=\\"681\\" data-end=\\"711\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Tambahkan Rak Dinding Kayu</span><br data-start=\\"711\\" data-end=\\"714\\">Hemat ruang sekaligus jadi dekorasi.</p></li><li data-start=\\"756\\" data-end=\\"848\\"><p data-start=\\"759\\" data-end=\\"848\\"><span data-start=\\"759\\" data-end=\\"792\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Pilih Kursi dengan Aksen Kayu</span><br data-start=\\"792\\" data-end=\\"795\\">Menambah estetika tanpa mengorbankan kenyamanan.</p></li><li data-start=\\"849\\" data-end=\\"945\\"><p data-start=\\"852\\" data-end=\\"945\\"><span data-start=\\"852\\" data-end=\\"888\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Gunakan Dekorasi Kecil dari Kayu</span><br data-start=\\"888\\" data-end=\\"891\\">Seperti tempat pensil, lampu meja, atau jam kayu.</p></li><li data-start=\\"946\\" data-end=\\"1040\\"><p data-start=\\"949\\" data-end=\\"1040\\"><span data-start=\\"949\\" data-end=\\"985\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Kombinasikan dengan Tanaman Hias</span><br data-start=\\"985\\" data-end=\\"988\\">Kayu + tanaman = nuansa alami yang menenangkan.</p></li></ol><p style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\"></p><p data-start=\\"1042\\" data-end=\\"1131\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">👉 Sentuhan kecil kayu bisa membuat ruang kerja jadi lebih produktif sekaligus estetik.</p>","en":"Wood is not only a basic material for furniture, but also an element that is able to provide a warm and natural atmosphere in the workspace. Here are some tips for managing your workspace with a touch of wood: Use the minimalism wooden table with natural finishing makes the room feel calmer and focused. Add the wall rack of the room at the same time to decorate. Choose a chair with the accent of the aesthetics without sacrifice Making work space more productive and aesthetic."}',
