            6 => 
            array (
                'id' => '6b8f4368-3c36-4cf7-81af-3390ef44ffc0',
                'img' => 'news_20250923110645.jpg',
                'judul' => '{"id":"Cara Merawat Furnitur Kayu agar Awet & Tetap Indah","en":"How to care for wood furniture to be durable & stay beautiful"}',
            'deskripsi' => '{"id":"<p data-start=\\"2078\\" data-end=\\"2189\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">Furnitur kayu adalah investasi jangka panjang. Supaya tetap awet dan indah, berikut tips perawatan sederhana:</p><ol data-start=\\"2191\\" data-end=\\"2682\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\"><li data-start=\\"2191\\" data-end=\\"2288\\"><p data-start=\\"2194\\" data-end=\\"2288\\"><span data-start=\\"2194\\" data-end=\\"2231\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Hindari Paparan Langsung Matahari</span><br data-start=\\"2231\\" data-end=\\"2234\\">Panas bisa membuat kayu retak atau warna memudar.</p></li><li data-start=\\"2289\\" data-end=\\"2383\\"><p data-start=\\"2292\\" data-end=\\"2383\\"><span data-start=\\"2292\\" data-end=\\"2331\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Gunakan Lap Kering / Setengah Basah</span><br data-start=\\"2331\\" data-end=\\"2334\\">Jangan terlalu basah agar kayu tidak lembap.</p></li><li data-start=\\"2384\\" data-end=\\"2484\\"><p data-start=\\"2387\\" data-end=\\"2484\\"><span data-start=\\"2387\\" data-end=\\"2425\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Poles dengan Minyak Kayu / Beeswax</span><br data-start=\\"2425\\" data-end=\\"2428\\">Menjaga kilau alami sekaligus melindungi permukaan.</p></li><li data-start=\\"2485\\" data-end=\\"2584\\"><p data-start=\\"2488\\" data-end=\\"2584\\"><span data-start=\\"2488\\" data-end=\\"2530\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Jauhkan dari Air &amp; Kelembaban Berlebih</span><br data-start=\\"2530\\" data-end=\\"2533\\">Simpan di ruangan dengan sirkulasi udara baik.</p></li><li data-start=\\"2585\\" data-end=\\"2682\\"><p data-start=\\"2588\\" data-end=\\"2682\\"><span data-start=\\"2588\\" data-end=\\"2613\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Bersihkan Noda Segera</span><br data-start=\\"2613\\" data-end=\\"2616\\">Tumpahan minuman sebaiknya langsung dilap agar tidak meresap.</p></li></ol><p style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\"></p><p data-start=\\"2684\\" data-end=\\"2786\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">👉 Dengan perawatan rutin, furnitur kayu bisa bertahan puluhan tahun sambil tetap cantik dan elegan.</p>","en":"Wood furniture is a long -term investment. To stay durable and beautiful, here are simple maintenance tips: Avoid direct exposure to sun heat can make wood cracked or fade color. Use dry cloth / half wetness. last decades while staying beautiful and elegant."}',
