                'judul' => '{"id":"Kayu Arem Memberdayakan SDM Lokal Melalui Program CSR","en":"Arem wood empower local human resources through the CSR program"}',
            'deskripsi' => '{"id":"<p style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">Kayu Arem percaya bahwa keberhasilan sebuah usaha bukan hanya diukur dari produk yang dihasilkan, tetapi juga dari kontribusinya terhadap lingkungan sekitar. Sebagai bagian dari program&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"590\\" data-end=\\"631\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR)</span>, KayuArem menjalankan inisiatif untuk&nbsp;<span data-start=\\"670\\" data-end=\\"700\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">memberdayakan SDM setempat</span>&nbsp;di wilayah Bekasi.</p><p data-start=\\"723\\" data-end=\\"818\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">Program ini dilakukan dengan melibatkan masyarakat sekitar dalam berbagai aktivitas, seperti:</p><ul data-start=\\"819\\" data-end=\\"1156\\" style=\\"padding-left: 2rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\"><li data-start=\\"819\\" data-end=\\"947\\"><p data-start=\\"821\\" data-end=\\"947\\"><span data-start=\\"821\\" data-end=\\"865\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Pelatihan dasar kerajinan kayu &amp; akrilik</span>, untuk memberi keterampilan baru yang bisa menjadi sumber penghasilan tambahan.</p></li><li data-start=\\"948\\" data-end=\\"1047\\"><p data-start=\\"950\\" data-end=\\"1047\\"><span data-start=\\"950\\" data-end=\\"986\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Workshop kewirausahaan sederhana</span>, membekali peserta dengan kemampuan mengelola usaha kecil.</p></li><li data-start=\\"1048\\" data-end=\\"1156\\"><p data-start=\\"1050\\" data-end=\\"1156\\"><span data-start=\\"1050\\" data-end=\\"1100\\" style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">Kesempatan kerja langsung di workshop KayuArem</span>, sehingga warga dapat terlibat dalam proses produksi.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\\"1158\\" data-end=\\"1389\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">“Bagi kami, KayuArem bukan hanya tentang membuat produk, tapi juga tentang memberikan manfaat nyata bagi komunitas. Dengan melibatkan SDM lokal, kami ingin tumbuh bersama dan menciptakan dampak positif,” ujar perwakilan KayuArem.</p><p style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\"></p><p data-start=\\"1391\\" data-end=\\"1643\\" style=\\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\\">Selain meningkatkan keterampilan, kegiatan ini juga mempererat hubungan sosial antara KayuArem dan masyarakat sekitar. Harapannya, semakin banyak warga yang bisa ikut serta dalam industri kreatif, sekaligus menjaga tradisi kerajinan kayu tetap hidup.</p>","en":"Arem wood believes that the success of a business is not only measured by the products produced, but also from its contribution to the surrounding environment. As part of the Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) program, Kayarem runs the initiative to empower local human resources in the Bekasi area. This program is carried out by involving the surrounding community in various activities, such as: Basic Training of Wood & Ampllic Crafts, to provide new skills that can be an additional source of income. Simple entrepreneurship workshop, \\"For us, Kayarem is not only about making products, but also about providing concrete benefits for the community. By involving local human resources, we want to grow together and create positive impacts,\\" said Kayarem representative. Besides increasing skills, this activity also strengthens social relations between Kayarem and the surrounding community. The hope, more and more citizens can participate in the creative industry, while maintaining the tradition of wood crafts that remain alive."}',
